mm1_title.miniqsf is "01 - title.miniqsf" and "Mega Man - The Power Battle.qsflib" is its library, from Modland, folder
Capcom Q-Sound Format / Hideki OK / Megaman 1 - The Power Battle (qsf by Neill Corlett's format; ripped by Hideki OK):
https://modland.antarctica.no/pub/modules/Capcom%20Q-Sound%20Format/Hideki%20OK/Megaman%201%20-%20The%20Power%20Battle/
(mirrors: modland.com, ftp.amigascne.org/mirrors/ftp.modland.com). Song length tag 0:21, fade 0.
Licence: the .qsflib holds Capcom's CPS-2 sound ROM data (copyright 1995 Capcom). Not redistributable as a release asset:
this is a test fixture only and must be excluded from release packages and any public mirror of the repository.

I704c: the binaries are NOT in git (Capcom ROM data, public repo). tests/m3/qsf_real_decode.sh fetches them through
tests/m3/fetch_fixture.sh into tests/m3/fixtures/.cache (git-ignored) and checks the sha256; offline = ctest SKIP.
